@EmployeeManagement.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7031

### Health Check (Liveness Probe)
GET {{EmployeeManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/healthz
Accept: text/plain

### OpenAPI Document v1
GET {{EmployeeManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### Employee list - first page (defaults: pageNumber=1, pageSize=10)
GET {{EmployeeManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/employees
Accept: application/json

### Employee list - explicit paging
GET {{EmployeeManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/employees?pageNumber=2&pageSize=5
Accept: application/json

### Employee list - filtered by name, mobile number or email address
GET {{EmployeeManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/employees?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10&search=ada
Accept: application/json

### Employee list - invalid paging is rejected with a 400 problem+json response
GET {{EmployeeManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/employees?pageNumber=0&pageSize=101
Accept: application/json

